invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_sign_round.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh mldsa_sign_round
reason: a round passes with more than omega hints, which FIPS 204
  Algorithm 7 rejects, and the signer encodes it. The mldsa_sign_round
  proof holds that the round encodes only with at most omega hints, the
  count the rows' steps added, and that assertion fails.

--- old
    reject |= (MLD_OMEGA - count) >> 31;
--- new
    (void)count;
